<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Foxglove</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Datura</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5kHCsELTDAwAz3ghslicoO</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.480" end="00:05.380">Patience, that's all we need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.380" end="00:10.400">A chemical dream all for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.400" end="00:14.630">My head case is spinning around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.630" end="00:18.870">Just don't shoot it down like you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.870" end="00:23.360">So bar the front door and don't let it in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.360" end="00:28.460">I am the poster child, a sucker for original sin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.460" end="00:32.410">I'm such a bore, wish I could wind my neck in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.410" end="00:39.240">I don't deserve it, but I savour every touch of your skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.240" end="00:44.820">These fucking problems keep following me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.820" end="00:49.270">Maybe I'm the problem, maybe it's me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.270" end="00:53.310">Find me at the bottom because that's where I'll be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.310" end="00:59.490">No one's invincible, I'm stuck in the middle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.490" end="01:07.490" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.750" end="01:12.480">Free will is gathering dust</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.480" end="01:14.730">We do what wе must</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.730" end="01:17.290">To be good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.290" end="01:21.550">Slow down, you're moving too fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.550" end="01:27.960">The past is thе past, I'd change if I could</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.960" end="01:33.110">These fucking problems keep following me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.110" end="01:37.980">Maybe I'm the problem, maybe it's me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.980" end="01:42.270">Find me at the bottom because that's where I'll be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.270" end="01:48.500">No one's invincible, I'm stuck in the middle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.500" end="01:51.690" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.690" end="01:58.060">No one's invincible, I'm stuck in the middle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.060" end="02:00.910" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.910" end="02:07.090">No one's invincible, I'm stuck in the middle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.090" end="02:14.410" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.410" end="02:18.730">So bar the front door and don't let it in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.730" end="02:23.700">I am the poster child, a sucker for original sin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.700" end="02:27.960">I'm such a bore, wish I could wind my neck in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.960" end="02:34.280">I don't deserve it, but I savour every touch of your skin</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.280" end="02:42.280" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.220" end="02:56.030">These fucking problems keep following me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.030" end="03:00.650">Maybe I'm the problem</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.650" end="03:05.000">These fucking problems keep following me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.000" end="03:09.610">Maybe I'm the problem, maybe it's me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.610" end="03:14.340">Find me at the bottom because that's where I'll be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.340" end="03:20.690">No one's invincible, I'm stuck in the middle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.690" end="03:24.200" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.200" end="03:32.200">No one's invincible, I'm stuck in the middle, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.140" end="03:37.020">No one's invincible, I'm stuck in the middle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:37.020" end="03:41.020" /></div></body></tt>